    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Rates Sync with Anomaly Guard\nEvery 5 min: fetch prices (CoinGecko → Binance fallback) → compare with the last accepted price in MongoDB → update, hold, or confirm.\n\n**Per-asset decision**\n- `first` / `ok` → price updated + history row\n- `suspect` (jump > max %) → price NOT updated, streak +1, alert once\n- `confirmed_move` (N consecutive consistent readings) → price updated + alert\n\n**Source health:** failures are counted in `monitor_state`; WhatsApp alert after N failed runs (with cooldown), recovery message when it works again.",
        "height": 282,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "e971ae47-1286-48a1-8d9f-e2217d77c8bb",
